n it chooses a material, a process or an option."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_adr_0128", "label": "ADR-0128", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rules, decision trees, review definitions and trade studies are governed reference-data records on the Group A shared lifecycle, not code, so only released content governs work."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_not_a_calculation_engine", "label": "Not a Calculation Engine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "P02 compares recorded values against thresholds; where a rule needs a computed quantity the calculation layer computes it and the result is assessed as an input."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_ruleseverity", "label": "RuleSeverity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Binding (Prohibition, Requirement, Constraint) versus non-binding (Warning, Recommendation, Advisory); severity is not a weight. Must not, prefer and consider are three different statements."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_four_gap_outcomes", "label": "Four Gap Outcomes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NotRecorded, NotApplicable, EvidenceRequired and Indeterminate are distinct on purpose; not known to apply is never reported as known not to apply."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_iassessmentsubject", "label": "IAssessmentSubject", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The narrow typed seam between a rule and a P01 record, with per-library adapters exposing property availability from the family-traits table so not applicable is honest."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_ruleengine_evaluate", "label": "RuleEngine.Evaluate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A static pure function of rule, pin, subject and constants; AllOf and AnyOf evaluate every operand so a reviewer sees every reason; Not preserves a gap rather than inverting it to a pass."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_rulecatalog", "label": "RuleCatalog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_decisiontreecatalog", "label": "DecisionTreeCatalog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_group_b_engineering_intelligence_reviewdefinitioncatalog", "label": "ReviewDefinitionCatalog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/Group B Engineering Intelligence.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_